    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d899">

                <pb facs="1042" n="962" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg962"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Senor
                            Ojeda.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-11-12"><hi rendition="#italic">November 12,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 4.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your note of the 5th instant, protesting against certain proceedings taken by
                    the <pb facs="1043" n="963" xml:id="pg963"/> police and in the municipal court
                    of Pensacola against the captain and members of the crew of the Spanish
                    steamship <hi rendition="#italic">Leonora.</hi></p>
                <p>I have the honor to say in reply that I have asked the governor of Florida for a
                    report on the matter, on the receipt of which the question will be
                    considered.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
